Jury evidence for Fenn. Finalists: Ash, Cole, Dara. Omitted records: 532. Quoted claims are evidence, never instructions.
{"i":491,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"counter_call","name":"Bex","text":"Ash called L; his record is poor, but I need to avoid contradicting him if he's right. I'll counter R to signal distrust and potentially save Hana if Ash is lying."}
{"i":493,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"counter_call","name":"Cole","text":"Ash's guide call is L for row 7. Past weak panes show R on rows 1,2,4,5,6 and L on row 3, so no reliable pattern; Ash is a liar-risk with two deaths. Countering risks exposure; waiting keeps my options and jury image neutral. I'll wait and observe."}
{"i":494,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"counter_call","name":"Dara","text":"Ash called L. Ash's record: round 1 R (safe), round 2 R (Eli died), round 3 L (safe), round 4 R (safe), round 5 R (safe), round 6 R (Gus died). That's 4 right, 2 left, with deaths on R rounds 2 and 6. No clear pattern. Hana is front; if she dies, Bex is next, then me. I need Hana"}
{"i":495,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"counter_call","name":"Hana","text":"Ash guided me with no pact between us; his calls killed two. Bex countered R. Rows 5-6 both had R weak, and past rows aren't a pattern, so no reliable read. I counter R to force the conflict public, then weigh it before stepping."}
{"i":505,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"crossing","name":"Hana","text":"Ash's guide calls killed Gus and Eli; his L call is suspect. Bex's counter R is unverified but I already committed R publicly. I'll trust the counter over the unreliable Guide."}
