{"i":512,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"last_words","name":"Hana","text":"Ash's call killed me; Fenn died on the same bridge too. Bex at least survives on her own steps."}
{"i":514,"type":"last_words","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"last_words","name":"Hana","deathEvent":508,"text":"Ash's counter-call killed me and Fenn. Bex trusted only her own feet. Jury, remember that."}
{"i":516,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"guide_call","name":"Ash","text":"Row 8 safe is R. Call R publicly to save survivors and appear truthful to jury, despite past blame."}
{"i":518,"type":"guide_call","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"guide_call","name":"Ash","walker":"Bex","row":8,"side":"R"}
